*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0020
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-03-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 870
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0020.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> TRANSACTIONS IN LAST 24 HOURS
    05 DAILY-TXN-CNT      PIC 9(3).
    05 TXN-AMT            PIC 9(7)V99.
    *> DAYS SINCE ACCOUNT OPENED
    05 ACCT-AGE-DAYS      PIC 9(5).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> RISK LEVEL H/M/L
    05 RISK-LVL           PIC X VALUE 'L'.
        88 RISK-LOW VALUE 'L'.
    *> FRAUD RISK SCORE
    05 FRAUD-SCORE        PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM RATE-ACTIVITY
    DISPLAY "RISK-LVL=" RISK-LVL
    DISPLAY "FRAUD-SCORE=" FRAUD-SCORE
    STOP RUN.
RATE-ACTIVITY.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2004
    *>  IF DAILY-TXN-CNT > 12
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> VERY HIGH TRANSACTION VELOCITY
        WHEN DAILY-TXN-CNT > 15 AND TXN-AMT > 4000.00
            MOVE 'H' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 90 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        *> ELEVATED TRANSACTION VELOCITY
        WHEN DAILY-TXN-CNT GREATER THAN 6
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 60 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        *> ACTIVITY ON NEW ACCOUNT
        WHEN ACCT-AGE-DAYS LESS THAN 30
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 40 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        WHEN OTHER
            SET RISK-LOW TO TRUE
            MOVE 10 TO FRAUD-SCORE
    END-EVALUATE.
